        "value_types",
        "runtime",
        "forms"
      ],
      "signature": "ButtonRepresentation.Tile",
      "description": "A button for a finger: the picture large over the caption, the button's Note under them in a smaller face (a price, a count, a state), the whole filling what its sizer gives it. Put tiles in a grid sizer for a panel of them. A client older than protocol 8 shows a tile as picture and text.",
